{"id":"aeb4dd56db822ff0","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-recursive-definition.md","title":"Recursive Definition","display":"df-recursive-definition — Recursive Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-recursive-definition","aliases":["72-df-recursive-definition"],"display":"df-recursive-definition — Recursive Definition","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.1.1; print232; PDF244; explicit function-graph construction","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-recursive-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-recursive-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-definition — Recursive Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.1.1; print232; PDF244; explicit function-graph construction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为 ZFC，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；有限元组采用函数编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\omega^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。数值函数按元数记录为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n,f)\">\\((n,f)\\)</span>，包括零元函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak F_n\">\\(\\mathfrak F_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^n\">\\(\\omega^n\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的部分函数图集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathfrak F_m\">\\(g\\in\\mathfrak F_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}\\in\\mathfrak F_n\">\\(h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}\\in\\mathfrak F_n\\)</span>。在 Rec 分支，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathfrak F_k\">\\(g\\in\\mathfrak F_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathfrak F_{k+2}\">\\(h\\in\\mathfrak F_{k+2}\\)</span>。下式只用函数图隶属关系，不把未定义值当自然数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak T_n\\subseteq\\mathfrak F_n\">\\(\\mathfrak T_n\\subseteq\\mathfrak F_n\\)</span> 是总函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 及递归/复合构造由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f,n)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak F_n:=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^n\\times\\omega:\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\ ((\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z)\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak T_n:=\\{f\\in\\mathfrak F_n:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak F_n:=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^n\\times\\omega:\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\ ((\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z)\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak T_n:=\\{f\\in\\mathfrak F_n:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_n(g;\\vec h):=\\{\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\land\\exists\\vec y\\in\\omega^m\\ (\\langle\\vec y,z\\rangle\\in g\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\langle\\vec x,y_i\\rangle\\in h_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Comp}_n(g;\\vec h):=\\{\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\land\\exists\\vec y\\in\\omega^m\\ (\\langle\\vec y,z\\rangle\\in g\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\langle\\vec x,y_i\\rangle\\in h_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k(g,h):=\\{\\langle\\langle a\\rangle^\\frown\\vec x,z\\rangle:a\\in\\omega\\land\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\land\\exists s\\in\\omega^{a+1}\\ (\\langle\\vec x,s_0\\rangle\\in g\\land s_a=z\\land\\forall i&lt;a\\ \\langle\\langle i,s_i\\rangle^\\frown\\vec x,s_{i+1}\\rangle\\in h)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rec}_k(g,h):=\\{\\langle\\langle a\\rangle^\\frown\\vec x,z\\rangle:a\\in\\omega\\land\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\land\\exists s\\in\\omega^{a+1}\\ (\\langle\\vec x,s_0\\rangle\\in g\\land s_a=z\\land\\forall i&lt;a\\ \\langle\\langle i,s_i\\rangle^\\frown\\vec x,s_{i+1}\\rangle\\in h)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z_n:=\\{\\langle\\vec x,0\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\},\\quad S:=\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\},\\quad P_i^n:=\\{\\langle\\vec x,x_i\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\}\\quad(i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z_n:=\\{\\langle\\vec x,0\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\},\\quad S:=\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\},\\quad P_i^n:=\\{\\langle\\vec x,x_i\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\}\\quad(i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PR}_0&amp;:=\\{(n,Z_n):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{(1,S)\\}\\cup\\{(n,P_i^n):i&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_{j+1}&amp;:=\\mathrm{PR}_j\\cup\\{(n,\\mathrm{Comp}_n(g;\\vec h)) :n\\in\\omega\\land(m,g)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\land\\vec h\\in\\mathfrak T_n^m\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (n,h_i)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup\\{(k+1,\\mathrm{Rec}_k(g,h)):(k,g),(k+2,h)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{PR}_j,\\qquad\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f,n)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (n,f)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PR}_0&amp;:=\\{(n,Z_n):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{(1,S)\\}\\cup\\{(n,P_i^n):i&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_{j+1}&amp;:=\\mathrm{PR}_j\\cup\\{(n,\\mathrm{Comp}_n(g;\\vec h)) :n\\in\\omega\\land(m,g)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\land\\vec h\\in\\mathfrak T_n^m\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (n,h_i)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup\\{(k+1,\\mathrm{Rec}_k(g,h)):(k,g),(k+2,h)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{PR}_j,\\qquad\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f,n)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (n,f)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第 IV 章 §2.1.1，印刷 p.232 / PDF p.244 列出常数、投影、后继、Sub 和 Rec；这里给出有元数的函数图实现。有限递归见证 s 的每一项由前一项唯一决定；总输入时依自然数递归存在。复合也单值且保持总性，因此所有 PR 层元素都是相应元数的总函数。有限层并是包含初始函数且对两种操作闭合的最小类：每个有限构造只用有限多个前层，取其层数最大值即可。\n旧式中的“唯一函数”“closed under composition”等自然语言已经展开，元数和递归参数次序不再隐含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(n,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak F_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathfrak F_m","display":false},{"tex":"h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}\\in\\mathfrak F_n","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathfrak F_k","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathfrak F_{k+2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak T_n\\subseteq\\mathfrak F_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak F_n:=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^n\\times\\omega:\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\ ((\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z)\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak T_n:=\\{f\\in\\mathfrak F_n:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_n(g;\\vec h):=\\{\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\land\\exists\\vec y\\in\\omega^m\\ (\\langle\\vec y,z\\rangle\\in g\\land\\forall i<m\\ \\langle\\vec x,y_i\\rangle\\in h_i)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_k(g,h):=\\{\\langle\\langle a\\rangle^\\frown\\vec x,z\\rangle:a\\in\\omega\\land\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\land\\exists s\\in\\omega^{a+1}\\ (\\langle\\vec x,s_0\\rangle\\in g\\land s_a=z\\land\\forall i<a\\ \\langle\\langle i,s_i\\rangle^\\frown\\vec x,s_{i+1}\\rangle\\in h)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Z_n:=\\{\\langle\\vec x,0\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\},\\quad S:=\\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,x+1\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\},\\quad P_i^n:=\\{\\langle\\vec x,x_i\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\}\\quad(i<n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PR}_0&:=\\{(n,Z_n):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{(1,S)\\}\\cup\\{(n,P_i^n):i<n<\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_{j+1}&:=\\mathrm{PR}_j\\cup\\{(n,\\mathrm{Comp}_n(g;\\vec h)) :n\\in\\omega\\land(m,g)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\land\\vec h\\in\\mathfrak T_n^m\\land\\forall i<m\\ (n,h_i)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\cup\\{(k+1,\\mathrm{Rec}_k(g,h)):(k,g),(k+2,h)\\in\\mathrm{PR}_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{PR}_j,\\qquad\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f,n)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (n,f)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3227,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"元理论为 ZFC。$\\mathfrak F_n,\\mathfrak T_n$ 及以有限元组为输入的函数图取 [[72-df-recursive-definition]]；$\\operatorname{RecFun},\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}$ 取 [[72-df-recursive-function]]。$\\langle\\rangle$ 是唯一零元输入，$\\vec a^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle$ 表示串接。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-definition|df-recursive-definition — Recursive Definition]]"},{"id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak F_n,\\mathrm{Comp}_n,\\mathrm{Rec}_k$、初始函数及 $\\mathrm{PR}_0$ 见 [[72-df-recursive-definition]]；$f\\in\\mathfrak F_n$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-recursive-definition|df-recursive-definition — Recursive Definition]]"}],"outgoing":[]}